I think it depends on how far in the game you are.
In the early game, there isn't much killing you that
would stop doing so if you had MR. Later, more and
more spellcasters cast dangerous spells, including
touch of death and paralysis. This continues to the
Astral Plane where the priests may cast paralysis,
which makes MR almost necessary there. (Of course,
you *can* ascend without any of MR/reflection. It's
just not a really good idea.)

Reflection, on the other hand, protects you from
attack wands and breath attacks. Later, you can
gain resistances to these individual types of ray;
while it doesn't protect you inventory, IIRC, you
could survive more easily without reflection at that
point. (There's also Medusa; but you can blind yourself
or polyself for that. And you'll know that she's there
because she has her own level, so you have time to
prepare yourself.)


